#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:1
msgid "The MyPaint Brush Engine manual page."
msgstr "De handleidingspagina voor de myPaint-penseel-engine."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:11
#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:17
msgid "MyPaint Brush Engine"
msgstr "MyPaint-engine"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:11
msgid "Brush Engine"
msgstr "Penseel-engine"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:21
msgid ".. image:: images/icons/mypaintbrush.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: images/icons/mypaintbrush.svg"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:22
msgid ""
"`MyPaint <http://www.mypaint.org>`_ is a free painting program that comes "
"with a lot of specific brushes. Krita can use those brushes for painting "
"using the MyPaint brush engine."
msgstr ""
"`MyPaint <http://www.mypaint.org>`_ is een vrij tekenprogramma die veel "
"speciale penselen heeft, Krita kan voor het schilderen deze penselen "
"gebruiken door de MyPaint Penseel engine te gebruiken."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:25
msgid "Dynamic Inputs"
msgstr "Dynamische invoeren"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:27
msgid ""
"Dynamic Inputs are a way for MyPaint to get information of the external "
"devices as a drawing tablet; for instance the pressure over the drawing "
"tablet, the speed of pencil movement, the pencil tilt .. etc. They are "
"equivalent to :ref:`sensors` in Krita."
msgstr ""
"Dynamische Invoeren zijn een manier voor MyPaint om informatie te krijgen "
"van externe apparaten zoals een tekentablet; bijvoorbeeld de druk "
"uitgeoefend op het tekentablet, de bewegingssnelheid van het potlood, de "
"hoek van het potlood .. enz. Ze zijn het equivalent van :ref:`sensors` in "
"Krita."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:29
msgid "MyPaint has 9 inputs:"
msgstr "MyPaint heeft 9 invoeren:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:32
msgid "Pressure"
msgstr "Druk"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:32
msgid "The pressure handled by a tablet. Typically in the range 0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"De druk uitgeoefend op een tablet. Standaard in de range van 0.0 tot 1.0."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:35
msgid "Fine Speed"
msgstr "Fijnsnelheid"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:35
msgid "How quickly the stylus is moving. This can vary quite a lot."
msgstr "Hoe snel is de stylus aan het bewegen. dit erg variëren."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:38
msgid "Gross Speed"
msgstr "Ruwe snelheid"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:38
msgid "Similar to fine speed but it changes very slowly."
msgstr "Vergelijkbaar met de fijnsnelheid maar deze verandert langzaam."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:41
msgid "Random"
msgstr "Willekeurig"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:41
msgid "Fast and random noise, changes with every brush stroke."
msgstr "Snelle en willekeurige ruis, verandert met elke penseelstreek."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:44
#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:238
msgid "Stroke"
msgstr "Streek"

# "stroke duration"komt bij mij niet voor in menu
#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:44
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This input goes slowly from 0.0 to 1.0 while the stroke is being applied. "
"This is related to \"stroke duration\" and \"stroke holdtime\" settings."
msgstr ""
"Deze invoer gaat langzaam van 0.0 naar 1.0 terwijl de penseelstreek wordt "
"uitgevoerd. Dit is afhankelijk van de ingestelde \"tijdsduur van streek\" en "
"\"houdtijd van streek\"."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:47
msgid "Direction"
msgstr "Richting"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:47
msgid "This input defines the angle of a stroke, in degrees."
msgstr "Deze invoer geeft de richting van de penseelstreek aan, in graden."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:50
#, fuzzy
msgid "Declination"
msgstr "Declinatie"

# controleer "elevation" in menu, "tilt-elevation"is hellingshoek
#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:50
msgid ""
"This input defines the declination of the stylus tilt. This is the same as "
"tilt-elevation in Krita."
msgstr ""
"Deze invoer geeft de declinatie van de stylus aan. Dit is hetzelfde als de "
"hellinghoek in Krita."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:53
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ascension"
msgstr "Oplopend"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:53
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Straight pen ascension. When the active tip points to it, it is 0. When the "
"pen turns 90 degrees clockwise is +90. When it turns 90 degrees "
"counterclockwise is -90. This is the same as tilt-direction in Krita."
msgstr "Loodrecht staande stylus."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:56
msgid ""
"This is a user-defined input. It is related to the \"customized input\" "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Dit is een door de gebruiker gedefinieerde invoer. Het houdt verband met de "
"instelling \"Aangepaste invoer\"."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/mypaint_engine.rst:57
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Aangepast"

